  - `PM 03` (PM-00003) - Prime Mover Mercedes Benz 4928T\n- **Status Eksekusi WUR EW**: 21 unit Terealisasi, 1 unit Pending (Dozer 10).\n\n### B. RENCANA SERVICE UNIT PROJECT RWI (6 Unit)\nFokus pada unit soil stabilization, road reclaiming, dan armada water tank pendukung:\n- `RM-03` (BRR-RM-4103) - Wirtgen 240X *(Realisasi Warranty GMT)*\n- `CS-01` (CS-41001) - Powder Binder Spreader XCMG XKC185 *(Pending, banyak standby)*\n- `DT 50` (WT-41002) - Water Tank Fuso *(Realisasi)*\n- `DT 49` (WT 41005) - Water Tank Fuso *(Realisasi)*\n- `DT 48` (WT 41004) - Water Tank Fuso *(Realisasi)*\n- `RM-02` (RM-41002) - Road Reclaimer CAT RM500B *(Carry-over Agustus, Pending belum sampai HM)*\n- **Status Eksekusi RWI**: 4 unit Terealisasi, 2 unit Pending (CS-01, RM-02).\n\n### C. RENCANA SERVICE UNIT PROJECT MATTING BOARD (5 Unit)\nArmada crane pengangkut dan truk flatbed di bawah skema warranty resmi Mitsubishi Fuso:\n- `TMC-03` (TMC-31002) - Truck Crane FN62FL *(Realisasi)*\n- `TMC-04` (TMC-31003) - Truck Crane FN62FL *(Realisasi)*\n- `TMC-05` (TMC-31004) - Truck Crane FN62FL *(Realisasi)*\n- `TMC-06` (TMC-31005) - Truck Crane FN62FL *(Pending, Full Job)*\n- `FBT-02` (FBT-31002) - Flat Bed Truck FN62FL *(Realisasi)*\n- **Status Eksekusi Matting Board**: 4 unit Terealisasi, 1 unit Pending (TMC-06).\n\n### D. RENCANA SERVICE UNIT LAHAT PROJECT (4 Unit)\nArmada dump truck yang dialokasikan di area operasi Lahat:\n- `DT 001` (ABA-083) - Dump Truck Hino FM 260 JD *(Pending, menunggu respon PIC Lahat)*\n- `DT 102` (ABA-097) - Dump Truck Hino FM8JN2D-XGJ *(Realisasi)*\n- `DT 111` (ABA-103) - Dump Truck Hino FM 280 JD *(Realisasi)*\n- `DT 115` (ABA-108) - Dump Truck Hino FM 280 JD *(Realisasi)*\n- **Status Eksekusi Lahat**: 3 unit Terealisasi, 1 unit Pending (DT 001).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Ringkasan Pengesahan Dokumen (Signatures)\n\n| Peran / Posisi | Nama | Jabatan | Keterangan Tanda Tangan pada Sumber |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Mengetahui / Mengoreksi** | Widya Apriani | GM Asset Manageme